{"route":"/docs/5.1/utilities/interactions/","version":"5.1","renderedVersion":"5.1","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Interactions","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Utility classes that change how users interact with contents of a website."},"blocks":[{"id":"text-selection","type":"heading","en":"Text selection","level":2},{"id":"text-selection--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Change the way in which the content is selected when the user interacts with it."},{"id":"text-selection--example-1","type":"demo","key":"1d07acb7c58d06338c6b","height":201},{"id":"text-selection--code-1","type":"code","value":"<p class=\"user-select-all\">This paragraph will be entirely selected when clicked by the user.</p>\n<p class=\"user-select-auto\">This paragraph has default select behavior.</p>\n<p class=\"user-select-none\">This paragraph will not be selectable when clicked by the user.</p>","language":"html"},{"id":"pointer-events","type":"heading","en":"Pointer events","level":2},{"id":"pointer-events--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap provides <code>.pe-none</code> and <code>.pe-auto</code> classes to prevent or add element interactions."},{"id":"pointer-events--example-1","type":"demo","key":"376fffd49f2b4a6bb4a6","height":201},{"id":"pointer-events--code-1","type":"code","value":"<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"pe-none\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-disabled=\"true\">This link</a> can not be clicked.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"pe-auto\">This link</a> can be clicked (this is default behavior).</p>\n<p class=\"pe-none\"><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-disabled=\"true\">This link</a> can not be clicked because the <code>pointer-events</code> property is inherited from its parent. However, <a href=\"#\" class=\"pe-auto\">this link</a> has a <code>pe-auto</code> class and can be clicked.</p>","language":"html"},{"id":"pointer-events--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"The <code>.pe-none</code> class (and the <code>pointer-events</code> CSS property it sets) only prevents interactions with a pointer (mouse, stylus, touch). Links and controls with <code>.pe-none</code> are, by default, still focusable and actionable for keyboard users. To ensure that they are completely neutralized even for keyboard users, you may need to add further attributes such as <code>tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;</code> (to prevent them from receiving keyboard focus) and <code>aria-disabled=&quot;true&quot;</code> (to convey the fact they are effectively disabled to assistive technologies), and possibly use JavaScript to completely prevent them from being actionable."},{"id":"pointer-events--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"If possible, the simpler solution is:"},{"id":"pointer-events--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"pointer-events--item-1","type":"item","en":"For form controls, add the <code>disabled</code> HTML attribute."}]}]},{"id":"pointer-events--list-2","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"pointer-events--item-2","type":"item","en":"For links, remove the <code>href</code> attribute, making it a non-interactive anchor or placeholder link."}]}]},{"id":"sass","type":"heading","en":"Sass","level":2},{"id":"utilities-api","type":"heading","en":"Utilities API","level":3},{"id":"utilities-api--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Interaction utilities are declared in our utilities API in <code>scss/_utilities.scss</code>. <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/utilities/api/#using-the-api\">Learn how to use the utilities API.</a>"},{"id":"utilities-api--code-1","type":"code","value":"    \"user-select\": (\n      property: user-select,\n      values: all auto none\n    ),\n    \"pointer-events\": (\n      property: pointer-events,\n      class: pe,\n      values: none auto,\n    ),","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"1d07acb7c58d06338c6b","html":"\n<p class=\"user-select-all\">This paragraph will be entirely selected when clicked by the user.</p>\n<p class=\"user-select-auto\">This paragraph has default select behavior.</p>\n<p class=\"user-select-none\">This paragraph will not be selectable when clicked by the user.</p>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"376fffd49f2b4a6bb4a6","html":"\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"pe-none\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-disabled=\"true\">This link</a> can not be clicked.</p>\n<p><a href=\"#\" class=\"pe-auto\">This link</a> can be clicked (this is default behavior).</p>\n<p class=\"pe-none\"><a href=\"#\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-disabled=\"true\">This link</a> can not be clicked because the <code>pointer-events</code> property is inherited from its parent. However, <a href=\"#\" class=\"pe-auto\">this link</a> has a <code>pe-auto</code> class and can be clicked.</p>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/parcel/"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/accessibility/"},{"en":"RFS","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/rfs/"},{"en":"RTL","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/rtl/"},{"en":"Contribute","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/contribute/"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/overview/"},{"en":"Sass","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/sass/"},{"en":"Options","href":"https://get